window.products.push({"id":699094,"name":"ROVSUN Air Fryer Oven Combo, 17 Quarts 10-in-1 Air Fryer Toaster Oven Dehydrator with Rotisserie & Racks, 1800W Airfryer 8 Cooking Presets & 9 Accesso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IKgyh9p3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALL IN 1 AIR FRYER: This air fryer has ETL certification, combines the functions of air fryer + oven + rotisserie +dehydrator,built-in digital one-touch screen menu, with 8 preset settings, including steak, poultry, seafood, shrimp, bacon, frozen food, French fries, vegetables, root vegetables, bread, desserts, Warm up. The dehydration function can be used for foods such as fruits, vegetables and beef jerky, and has 3 dehydration racks, which can cook multiple batches at a time. SAFE & EASY TO OPERATE: It has 120V, 1800W automatic shutdown function to prevent over-cooking, overheat protection, convenient and safe. Using the digital touch screen control panel, you can quickly and easily select the cooking mode, and you can also set and view the time and temperature more conveniently to cook different types of food. With a cool touch handle and butt on protection cover to prevent accidental disassembly. LARGE CAPACITY & VISIBLE WINDOW : 16.91 quarts / 16L large capacity design, with a compact design, so it can allow you to prepare ample gourmet food for your family members and does not take up too much space. Double Layer window with inside glass and outside transperant PC. Power Lighting inside, give you a good vision and cool touch. COMPLETE COOKING ACCESSORIES: Each air fryer oven is equipped with a drip tray, reclaimer, chicken spit, 3 dehydration racks, skewers, grill and manual 9 accessories, which contain everything you need, so you can easily enjoy a good meal. OIL-FREE HEALTHY FOOD: Compared with the traditional hot oil cooking method, the air fryer adopts a new technology of 360° hot air circulation to cook food. It can reduce fat by up to 80%, and the cooking speed is fast, without splashing oil vapor on the kitchen countertop. So you can easily provide you with healthy food and delicious dishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IKgyh9p3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROVSUN","source_asin":"B07JZ487T2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-699094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JZ487T2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JZ487T2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
