window.products.push({"id":699264,"name":"Plastic Shower Curtain - 72 x 72 inch, Polka Dot Shower Curtain, Waterproof PEVA Shower Curtain for Bathroom, with 12 Plastic Hooks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AwL547KCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌹【PVC Free】This shower curtain is 100% made of PEVA material, which is not only light in weight (0.77lbs), but also free of harmful substances. Without the grommet, the shower curtain will stay clean and will not be rusted 🌹【Beautiful and Practical】This shower curtain has a beautiful polka dot pattern, which can be used as both a liner and a shower curtain. Thicker, drapes very well, this curtain is practical and good-looking. With the standard 72*72inch size, it is suitable for most bathrooms. 🌹【100% Waterproof】The PEVA shower curtain prevent perfectly the water from splashing outside when you take a shower. This semi-transparent PEVA material can allow the light in while stopping water from going out, giving you a clean bathroom. 🌹【Easy Care】This shower curtain is very easy to clean after use, just wipe it gently with a cloth. You don't need (and can not) put it into the washing machine. 🌹【12 Plastic Hooks】With the shower curtain also comes with 12 plastic hooks. The installation is very easy and convenient, it only takes 5 minutes to install and you will get a pretty polka dot shower curtain. 🌹【Attractive Design】This shower curtain has a beautiful appearance and separates the shower from the toilet. It will definitely make your toilet more clean, tidy, and bright.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AwL547KCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"karadrova","source_asin":"B0BDFWNRKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-699264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDFWNRKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDFWNRKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
