window.products.push({"id":699270,"name":"Pursetti Casserole Carriers for Hot or Cold Food, Perfect Insulated Food Carrier for Potluck, HolidayParties/Picnic/Cookouts, Fits 9\"x13\" Baking Dish ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9160q1IXRWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep Food Hot or Cold for Hours-Portable insulated casserole carrier to transport your signature dish to a holiday party, family dinner, potluck, or office function in style. Carry a pan of lasagna on top, a salad on the bottom, utensils, and napkins in the top pocket. Recommend resting the baked dish from the oven for 15 minutes to avoid melting of the insulation lining. You can also use a kitchen towel to wrap the baking dish before placing in the double casserole carrier. Made to Last with Quality Materials/Zippers/Craftsmanship-The exterior of the casserole bag is made of 600D water-resistant polyester for durability and easy cleaning. The interior is constructed with thick thermal foil to help retain the temperature on your way to a party. Dual compartments of the casserole dish carrier offer two separate layers for a pan of lasagna on top and a crisp/cold salad on the bottom. Stash utensils and napkins in the exterior top pocket. Perfect Size- It holds two 13\" L x 9\" W x 2\" H baking dishes. Exterior dimensions when expanded: 16\" L x 10\" W x 7.5\" H, with the same length & width but 5\" H when the top layer collapses. The interior dimensions of the top and bottom layers are: 16\" L x 10\" W x 3.5\" H. The utensil compartment on top: 15.5\" L x 7.5\" W, weight: 1.60 lbs. Baking dishes not included. You will get a lot of compliments about the classy casserole carrier when you bring it to a party! The comfortable handles with wrap on top make it easy to carry. Wide opening with dual zippers allows effortless loading and unloading. Collapse the top layer to save storage space when not in use. Spot clean any drips or spills on the outside or inside with a clean damp cloth. Not machine washable. Great Gift Idea-For Christmas, Birthday, Anniversary, Wedding, or Housewarming. Pursetti insulated carrier is guaranteed to delight the recipient. They will enjoy this thoughtful & practical gift for years. We stand behind the quality of materials and craftsmanship. Should you find any defect with either the materials and workmanship (excluding the normal wear and tear), message us via the Amazon Buyer portal with pictures as proof. We will be happy to send you a replacement for free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9160q1IXRWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pursetti","source_asin":"B084T85RNP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-699270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084T85RNP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084T85RNP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
