window.products.push({"id":699312,"name":"VICHERIA Incense Holder for Sticks Anti-ash Flying Glass Ash Catcher Wooden Incense Burner with Brass Incense Clip","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51heIAStPbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【▶INNOVATIVE DESIGN】 VICHERIA innovatively designed an incense burner to prevent dust from scattering. It can collect the dust left after the incense stick is burned in a glass bottle, so that the dust will no longer scatter on the desktop. At the same time, the glass bottle can form a stable air environment, so that the incense stick can burn stably in the glass bottle, even in the space with the electric fan open, it can be used well. 【▶SIMPLICITY&AESTHETICS】The simple and fashionable exterior design not only adapts to different styles of rooms, but also perfectly integrates into different usage scenarios.It's not just a incense burner，but also be used as a great office decor, office decor，artwork and desktop decoration . Whether it is meditation, stress relief, yoga room, spa, reading room, teahouse, temple, church, family or office . 【▶HIGH QUALITY】The incense burner is mainly composed of three parts. The base is made of high hardness walnut wood, and the natural wood grain is very beautiful. The bracket for holding the incense stick is made of high purity brass material, which has the characteristics of oxidation resistance, corrosion resistance and high hardness.It can maintain a metallic luster for a long time。The glass bottle is made of high silica borosilicate glass with high hardness and high temperature resistance 【▶EASYTO USE & CLEAN】Clamping your incense stick in place has never been easier,The end of the brass support rod is designed with a tapered clip that is wide on the outside and narrow on the inside. Push the incense into the gap, and the incense stick will be clamped tighter.The dust collecting bottle with free assembly and disassembly can be easily cleaned with the cleaning sponge we give away. 【▶PRODUCT PARAMETER】The VICHERIA stand up Incense Burner measures a compact 3.3 inches by 3.3 inches at the base and stands at 9.5 inches tall. The walnut chassis is combined with the brass support rod with a diameter of 4mm. Its compact size makes it an ideal addition to any room, from living rooms to meditation spaces, and it can easily fit on a shelf, desk, or table.Its elegant design also makes it a great decoration that can add to the peaceful atmosphere of any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51heIAStPbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VICHERIA","source_asin":"B0BYNPRX2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-699312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYNPRX2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYNPRX2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
