window.products.push({"id":699660,"name":"Bento Boxes For Adults-Leak Proof 3 Compartment Lunch Box For Kids & Adults Eat Out & Snacks - BPA Free Dishwasher Safe - Food Safe Materials (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HY8VvkdJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BVLFOOK bento box is an innovative bento-style lunch box, specially designed for children going out, no other children's lunch box can add all kinds of fun to lunch. This leak-proof lunch box has a compartment to store fruits, vegetables, dipping sauces, entrances and desserts, organically inspiring parents to pack a healthier and balanced lunch for their children. We spare no effort in the design details of BVLFOOK, because we know that it is never too early to start establishing healthy eating habits. The BVLFOOK bento box is recommended for children aged 3-7, but it is also a good choice for anyone who wants a portion-controlled lunch box. Put in pasta, chicken, salad, sandwiches, fruits, snacks or sushi and enjoy it anytime, anywhere. Three compartments help to plan a balanced diet, not only for men and women, but also for girls and boys to get comprehensive nutrition. Features of BVLFOOK Bento Box: ★ Our 100% food grade bento box can be used for cleaning the top shelf of microwave ovens, refrigerators, refrigerators and dishwashers. ★ Made of high-quality food-grade materials, this is the best bento box lunch food container for packaging healthy food. ★ No need for multiple plastic containers and bags-BVLFOOK Adult Bento Box can easily pack 3 different foods into a stylish lunch box. ★The BVLFOOK lunch box is made of high-quality food-grade materials and does not contain BPA, PVC, phthalate, lead or vinyl. ★ With dimensions of 8.4 x 5.7 x 3 inches (approximately 21.3 x 14.5 x 7.5 cm), this bento style 3 compartment lunch box can hold any type of main course, appetizer, carbohydrate, snack, fruit, vegetable and even dessert. ★ Our lunch boxes for adults and children are durable, leak-proof and shock-proof.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HY8VvkdJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BVLFOOK","source_asin":"B09PRW47SR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-699660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PRW47SR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PRW47SR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":699661,"name":"Brilliante Yerba Mate Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OeBCvNzfL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our Brilliante Set lets you get drinking delicious and stimulating yerba mate right away. The wooden \"mate\" (mate is the name of the gourd or cup used to drink mate tea) with aluminum skin can be used without curing like traditional gourds. The included high quality spring bombilla filters your mate for a smooth drinking experience. You also get a 7 oz package of our Especial Yerba Mate. Complete instructions for use and care are in the included WyndHorse Guide to Yerba Mate. To preserve the wood and shine of your Brilliante mate, hand wash only: do not put in dishwasher!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OeBCvNzfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WyndHorse Yerba Mate","source_asin":"B005NK3B26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-699661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005NK3B26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005NK3B26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
