window.products.push({"id":699755,"name":"Dyenamic Art Lake Rules Sign - Inspirational Sign - Lightweight Aluminum Decor - Indoor/Outdoor Metal Sign - Wall Art Decor Signs - Lakeside Decor Cus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XBUVheYlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY DYENAMIC ART? At Dyenamic Art, we strive to bring you new and fresh aluminum home indoor and outdoor decor metal signs for sale that are exclusively produced for you. We are a family-owned business in South Carolina that prides itself on excellent customer service and premium craftsmanship. Each design is perfectly together in the form of art and fully expressive. Make the walls of your house into a warm welcoming sign with our decor . LAKE RULES DECOR: Want to add a beautiful and inspirational touch to your home and give a touch of decor to your style? Our metal art signs come with the original graphic representation handcrafted by talented artists to provide an incredibly beautiful and pleasing aesthetic appearance. The materials used are also eco friendly and are of the best quality. The aluminum used in it does not rust or fade easily even with prolonged exposure to sunlight and rain. The Dyenamic Art metal sign is coated with UV resistant coating and is suitable for both indoor and outdoor decor. The rounded corners on the side of the signs are designed for style and safety. Installation of the sign is also effortless and does not require any special tools or additional labor. The sign comes with 2 pre-drilled holes on either side. These holes can be used to hang the signs with chains, rope, ribbons, or simply screw them to your favorite wall! You can even use double side adhesive tape to stick them to walls if you are not comfortable screwing them in. What are you waiting for then? Go place your order right away! Specification: Material: Lightweight aluminum Available Dimensions: 8 inches x 12 inches Features: Weather and UV resistant","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XBUVheYlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dyenamic Art","source_asin":"B09RX33686","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-699755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RX33686","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RX33686","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":699756,"name":"SimpleLife4U Sexy Leopard Print Self-Adhesive Shelf Drawer Liner Moisture Proof PVC Mat 45x300cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dJ8eZQI9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Features:1.Size: 17.7 inch(45cm) wide x 118 inch(3 meter) long, 0.1mm thick(Due to hand-made cutting, please leave a deviation of 3-6 cm.)2.Material: PVC paper . Paper Substrate:PVC resin. 3.Printing Technology: Water-based ink printing. Surface Workmanship: Textured.4.Function: Self-adhesive, waterproof, removable. Protect furnitures surface and inner，upgrade wall's looking. 5.Application: Dry and flat surface.6.Package Inclued: 1 X Shelf Liner RollATTENTION:1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only.2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface.4. Storage methods: stored at cool, dry and ventilated place. Because of PVC material, you can put it in a ventilated place to remove the vinyl smell. 5. If you buy more than two items, we may package your order into ONE ROLL with the toal length you ordered together in one parcel. But our other warehouse in local will send seperated roll.Installation:1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet,drawer,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature.2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water.3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter.4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dJ8eZQI9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SimpleLife4U","source_asin":"B018GKV18K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-699756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018GKV18K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018GKV18K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
