window.products.push({"id":699758,"name":"Cheese Slicer & Cutter - Multipurpose Stainless Steel Cheese and Food Slicer with 4\" Blade, Cheese Cutter Board with Accurate Size Scale for Cutting C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JNjvF4amL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀 [MULTI-USE CHEESE CUTTING BOARD]: A guillotine-type cheese slicer with cutting board, the actual blade makes it can cut soft to semi-hard cheeses, butter, spam, root vegetables like cucumbers, onions and radishes, or to slice deli meats and summer-style sausages (only after the casing was removed). Create a unique charcuterie board with various cheeses, meats, and vegetables at the same time, do save your time and with less mess. 🍀 [RELIABLE QUALITY]: Made of premium stainless steel for the whole cheese slicer, the stainless steel base doesn’t absorb odors and fats; While the metal blade is much sturdy for easy use, won't be easily stretch or broken like wires do, with 1 additional spare blade & sharpener included, sharpen the blade or replace the blade as per your need. 🍀 [SIZE GRID SCALE LINE FOR PRECISE & CLEAN CUT]: By lasering clear and precise grid scale lines on board surface, which help you to cut exactly according to the size you want from 1 MM, get rid of the guess work about that the slice is too large or too small. (Board size: 4.92inch * 8.27inch). 🍀 [ERGONOMIC HANDLE]: The round tube handle is 3inch long, comfortable for handgripping and ensures better control on cutting; 4 silicone non-slip feet allow you to cut any cheese without it moving around, also can protect your countertop from potential scratching damage. 🍀 [CHEESE SLICER WITH LOCK MEACHNISM] Newly add a locking mechnism under the blade, lock the sharp blade tight before storage, much safer even can be hanging for storage. 🍀 This would make a lovely wedding or shower gift, partnered with a variety of cheeses and a meat stick.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JNjvF4amL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Esie Houzie","source_asin":"B0BKJT43NV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-699758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKJT43NV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKJT43NV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":699759,"name":"GIPOBUY Portable Garment Rack, Foldable Travel Clothing Rack for Indoor Outdoor Drying Clothes, Dance, Travel Organizer, Camping, Laundry, New Upgrade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U9tk2E7FL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Easy Folding Design】Our drying rack adopt the latest technology design to make folding less laborious than other similar racks on the market, just twist the tube slightly to lock and release, practical and stylish, no installation needed, efficient and easy to use 【Extend Tips】When extend the rack, please stretch one the legs to the longest length, then you will see that there are groove in all joints of the tube, just rotate along each of the segments slightly to lock the groove.The same procedure for another 3 legs, then the rack can be stable. And you need to twist each of the segments on the tube in the opposite direction to unlock the groove before folding the rack 【Warm Tip】To enhance the portability, this portable garment rack has limited load-bearing capacity (Max Load Bearing Weight: 8.8 lbs/4kg), so please don't hang heavy wet clothes or use it on uneven areas or in high winds 【Leightweight and Portable】This foldable clothes drying rack weight only 1.32lbs and size 12.9x2.8 inches after folded, can be easily put in your handbag or travel backpack, suitable for travel, camping, hiking, dancing, business, hotel, college dorm, ironing clothes, dormitory, etc 【Free Retractable】The length of this portable clothes rack can be adjusted from 12.9 to 27.5 inches with 53.1 inches max height, variable size can meet your needs for different occasions, such as hotels, balconies, hallways, laundry rooms, bedrooms, gardens, university dorm rooms and apartments 【Premium Quality】 The tube is made of 18mm diameter stainless steel, no deformation, water and rust-resistant, and this collapsible clothing rack equipped with thick non-slip silicone leg covers, safe anti-skid, no noise when moving 【What You Get】1 easy foldable garment rack + 8 mini foldable travel hangers (Random Color) + 1 gray drawstring gift bag, it's convenient for you to carry around when travel, just an ideal gift for family, friends, outdoor campers and dance lovers 【Best Sale-After Service 】 GIPOBUY products are subject to strict manufacturing process and quality audit standards, your satisfaction is our only goal. If you have any problems with the product you receive, please feel free to contact us and we will provide after-sales service to your 100% satisfaction. You can also choose to return it directly for a refund. When returning, please put the folding clothes rack, 8 foldable hangers and flannel gift bags in the box and send it back. Note: Please don't buy it for heavy duty, but buy it for the convenience and portability.This is a great product if you use it for its intended purpose.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U9tk2E7FL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GIPOBUY","source_asin":"B0BLLHN7RD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-699759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLLHN7RD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLLHN7RD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
